# Cursor rules

This repo's AI-assistant conventions live in `CLAUDE.md` — read it before editing.

Quick orientation: a TypeScript npm-workspaces monorepo for QA automation (Playwright web + API,
WebdriverIO/Appium mobile, SQLite-based SQL suite) targeting automationexercise.com. See
`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` for the reasoning behind the structure and `README.md` for setup/run commands.
